      "writtenOn": "2026-09-25T15:59:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Without a call in progress, networkInterfaceChanged() does nothing; during a call it moves the call to a new channel and restarts ICE, which is short. On Linux, the connectivity monitor only reports changes of NetworkManager\u0027s active connections, so this should stay rare; we can filter further if it shows up in practice.",
      "parentUuid": "bd7988d6_daac6be4",
